---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Us - ChooseVS"
  description="Get in touch with the ChooseVS team. We'd love to hear your questions, feedback, suggestions, or partnership inquiries."
>
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-surface-900 mb-6">Contact Us</h1>

        <p class="text-xl text-surface-600 leading-relaxed mb-12">
          Have a question, feedback, or suggestion? We'd love to hear from you. Fill out the form below or reach us directly at <a href="mailto:hello@choosevs.com" class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700">hello@choosevs.com</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
          <!-- Contact Form -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-2">
            <div class="card p-8">
              <form class="space-y-6" action="#" method="POST">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                  <div>
                    <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-surface-700 mb-2">Full Name</label>
                    <input
                      type="text"
                      id="name"
                      name="name"
                      required
                      placeholder="John Doe"
                      class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 text-surface-800 placeholder-surface-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all"
                    />
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-surface-700 mb-2">Email Address</label>
                    <input
                      type="email"
                      id="email"
                      name="email"
                      required
                      placeholder="john@example.com"
                      class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 text-surface-800 placeholder-surface-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all"
                    />
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <label for="subject" class="block text-sm font-medium text-surface-700 mb-2">Subject</label>
                  <select
                    id="subject"
                    name="subject"
                    required
                    class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 text-surface-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all"
                  >
                    <option value="">Select a topic...</option>
                    <option value="general">General Inquiry</option>
                    <option value="feedback">Feedback</option>
                    <option value="correction">Content Correction</option>
                    <option value="partnership">Partnership / Collaboration</option>
                    <option value="advertising">Advertising</option>
                    <option value="other">Other</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-surface-700 mb-2">Message</label>
                  <textarea
                    id="message"
                    name="message"
                    required
                    rows="6"
                    placeholder="Tell us how we can help..."
                    class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 text-surface-800 placeholder-surface-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all resize-y"
                  ></textarea>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">
                  Send Message
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
                  </svg>
                </button>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Contact Info -->
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="card p-6">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-1">Email</h3>
                  <p class="text-surface-600 text-sm">For all inquiries:</p>
                  <a href="mailto:hello@choosevs.com" class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700 text-sm font-medium">hello@choosevs.com</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card p-6">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-1">Location</h3>
                  <p class="text-surface-600 text-sm">ChooseVS is a fully remote team. We don't have a physical office, but we're always reachable online.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card p-6">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-1">Response Time</h3>
                  <p class="text-surface-600 text-sm">We aim to respond to all inquiries within 24-48 business hours.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Section -->
        <div class="mt-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-surface-900 mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="card p-6">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">How do I suggest a comparison topic?</h3>
              <p class="text-surface-600">We love hearing topic suggestions from our readers! Simply send us an email at hello@choosevs.com with your idea. While we can't guarantee we'll cover every suggestion, we review every submission and prioritize topics based on reader demand.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card p-6">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">How can I report an error in a comparison?</h3>
              <p class="text-surface-600">Accuracy is our top priority. If you spot an error or outdated information, please let us know via the contact form or email. Include the specific comparison URL and the correction needed, and we'll update it promptly.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card p-6">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">Does ChooseVS accept sponsored content?</h3>
              <p class="text-surface-600">We maintain strict editorial independence. While we do display advertisements through networks like Google AdSense, we do not accept payment for editorial coverage or rankings. Any sponsored content that may appear in the future will be clearly labeled as such.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card p-6">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">Can I contribute as a writer or researcher?</h3>
              <p class="text-surface-600">We're always open to working with talented writers and researchers who share our commitment to accuracy and clarity. Send your portfolio and areas of expertise to hello@choosevs.com.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card p-6">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">How do I request removal of my personal data?</h3>
              <p class="text-surface-600">If you believe we hold any personal data about you and would like it removed, please contact us at hello@choosevs.com with your request. We process all data removal requests in accordance with applicable privacy laws.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
